
### `.gitignore`

I would use this:

```gitignore
# Python cache files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Python environment variables
.env
.env.*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Testing / coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Build files
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Saved machine learning models
*.pkl
*.joblib

# Local SQLite database files
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
